<title>BANGLADESH: Dhaka bourse closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Dhaka bourse closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) was closed on Thursday because of a public holiday.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index closed 233.2 points or 6.39 percent down at 3,415.54 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Saturday after Moslem Friday weekend.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
